OL,3,ASouth African president vows justice as
OL,4,Amore women's bodies found near
OL,5,AJohannesburg
OL,6,
OL,7,FSouth Africa's President Cyril
OL,8,FRamaphosa has vowed that "no stone will
OL,9,Fbe left unturned" in finding those
OL,10,Fbehind the killings of several women in
OL,11,Fand around the town of Kempton Park,
OL,12,Fnorth-east of Johannesburg, over the
OL,13,Flast two months.
OL,15,FTwo more bodies were discovered on
OL,16,FTuesday and police say their
OL,17,Finvestigation now includes the deaths
OL,18,Fof eight women, most of whom have been
OL,19,Ffound either partially or fully naked.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
