OL,3,ASouth African president vows justice as
OL,4,Amore women's bodies found near
OL,5,AJohannesburg
OL,6,
OL,7,F"These incidents are causing fear and
OL,8,Funcertainty in our communities, and
OL,9,Fespecially among women," the president
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FPolice say they are not linking the
OL,13,Fdeaths to a serial killer at this
OL,14,Fstage, but are investigating the
OL,15,Fpossibility that a group of people is
OL,16,Fbehind the killings.
